@startuml
title POST /api/ai-agents-teams/run/prepare + /send — invoke a deployed team, read back its run ledger
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #294C60
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF5FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #38789E
  LifeLineBorderColor #6A92AA
  GroupBackgroundColor #FFF3E8
  GroupBorderColor #D97638
}

actor "Caller" as Caller #FFD8C2
participant "AgentsTeamsApiSdk\n.run(agentTeamUri, prompt)" as SDK #D5EAF7
participant "Embers API" as API #FFC9A8
participant "AgentsTeamsService" as Domain #CDEACC
participant "F1r3node\nchain + observer" as Chain #FFE4A6

Caller -> SDK : run(agentTeamUri, prompt)

group Phase 1 — prepare (mints the run capability; deploys nothing)
SDK -> API : POST /api/ai-agents-teams/run/prepare\n{ agents_team: uri, prompt }
API -> Domain : prepare_run_agents_team_contract
Domain -> Domain : mint run_id = UUIDv7\n(the run capability);\ncompute request content and\ncapability hashes; render the\ninvocation contract
Domain --> API : RunResp { run_id, contract, created_at,\n  durable, definition_hash?,\n  request/continuation hashes }
API --> SDK : PrepareResponse { response, token }
end

group Sign and send — no finalization subscription
SDK -> SDK : signed = signContract(contract, privateKey)
SDK -> API : POST /api/ai-agents-teams/run/send\n{ prepare_request, prepare_response,\n  request: signed, token }
API -> API : verify the echo hash binding
API -> Domain : deploy and await finality
Domain -> Chain : deploy signed invocation
Chain --> Domain : finalized
Domain -> Chain : observer readback of the\nrun ledger (post-state)
Chain --> Domain : run-state JSON
API <-- Domain : run-state JSON
SDK <-- API : 200 (untyped run-state readback)
SDK --> Caller : { prepareResponse, sendResponse }
end

note over API #FFF0C7
The send response is the observer readback, not
a deploy id: the caller sees the exact post-state
it acted on. There is nothing to subscribe on —
finality already happened inside send. Ongoing
inspection is GET /runs/{run_id}, whose URL is
the read capability minted at prepare.
end note
@enduml
